# SyncWatch moved to its own origin (syncwatch.5dice.app) on 2026-09-25, so it
# installs as its own app instead of opening inside 5 Dice on Android.
#
# The first rule serves a self-removing worker in place of the old SyncWatch
# worker: browsers refuse to update a service worker through a redirect, so
# without it the old one would linger on this origin forever. It must stay
# above the redirect, since the first matching rule wins.
/SyncWatch/SyncWatch-sw.js  /syncwatch-retire-sw.js  200
/SyncWatch                  https://syncwatch.5dice.app/  301
/SyncWatch/*                https://syncwatch.5dice.app/:splat  301
